e_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/f3b33ba566cb887405ae08032e74b27f.webp?t=1755085997\" width=389 height=42 /></span><br>Besides inter-racial warfare, you'll also battle with neutral factions to secure key locations, gain rewards and special points for upgrading your army.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/e8137f04f05d92d2074b3e47c509213a.poster.avif?t=1755085997\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/e8137f04f05d92d2074b3e47c509213a.webm?t=1755085997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/e8137f04f05d92d2074b3e47c509213a.mp4?t=1755085997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/41b97e86070ed57f309886ce56ba3fee.webp?t=1755085997\" width=389 height=42 /></span><br>Play fully procedurally generated maps, each game offering a unique and never-before-seen map for both standard and custom game modes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/577b98247b4aa995383482a448fd2188.poster.avif?t=1755085997\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/577b98247b4aa995383482a448fd2188.webm?t=1755085997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637210/extras/577b98247b4aa995383482a448fd2188.mp4?t=1755085997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
